    "show_share": true,
    "description": "As part of our ongoing commitment to supporting institutions across the Aga Khan Development Network (AKDN) regions, the QTL_net team facilitated an introductory workshop on Effective Use of Technology at the University of Chitral, under the University Improvement Programme. The workshop was held from November 4-6, 2025 and guided 17 faculty and staff through hands-on, student-centred activities.",
